TTHUB
A full stack social platform build with VUE 3, Javascript, Vite, Express, PostgreSQL, Drizzle ORM and tailwindCSS.

TTHUB allows users to create accounts, publish posts, upload images and videos, interact with posts through likes and comments, reply to comments, and manage their profiles.

The project is designed using a monolithic architecture, keeping the application simple to develop and deploy while maintaining a clear separation between frontend, backend, database, authentication, and feature modules.

